      en: ["The forest is situated in the Nangnim Range of Chagang Province.", "It is a true primary forest untouched by human commercial activity.", "Dominant species include spruce, fir, and Siberian larch.", "The area is a documented habitat for the rare Siberian tiger.", "The forest is designated as a state-level strict nature reserve.", "The average elevation of the terrain is over 1,000 meters."],
